WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.970
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.910
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.980
I can say love

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.710
will you love me?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:38.320
The guy I just passed probably has no idea I just got back from space...

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:43.120
Being on other planets and meeting other races...

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.280
He wouldn't imagine it one bit...

00:01:55.370 --> 00:02:01.390
Lunar Vows

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.280
W-what are you all doing here?!

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:12.180
You've been given your first assignment and all, so...

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.280
Come on, you're getting married!

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.850
It's only natural for your family to be here!

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.320
Married...?

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:19.660
That's right, married!

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.360
Who is?

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.190
You are.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.230
To who?

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:25.260
Kiriko-chan, Amane-san, Ryoko-san, and Neige-chan!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.330
My first assignment...?

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.730
This tea's good!

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:28.800
Good...

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.970
What's going on?!

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.540
- Married?! Me?! - Get a hold of yourself!

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:37.440
You're going to marry the four people I just named! That's your first assignment!

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:40.240
How can my first assignment be to get married?!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.380
It's a political marriage!

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:46.280
It's political, but I'm just happy having four more daughters!

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:49.550
I'm so happy! Kiriko-san and the others are gonna be my sisters!

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:52.490
Come on! I can't just suddenly get married!

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:53.720
And besides, Kiriko-san and the others haven't...

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.730
I hear the ceremony's going to be held on the far side of the moon!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.930
It doesn't matter where it's gonna be!

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:03.190
Let go! I haven't finished yet! Come on...!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.380
He says he doesn't want anything to eat.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.710
Has he still not come to terms with it?

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.720
And the ceremony's tomorrow, too...!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.580
Don't be like that.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:25.260
Guys take this kind of stuff harder than girls do. Who would've thought...

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.640
"Oddity On Far Side Of Moon"

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.260
A political marriage...

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:39.140
I wonder how Kiriko-san and the rest feel about it...

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.800
A- Amane-san...!

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.610
You're horrible, Seina!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.910
I liked someone else, but now...!

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.070
Wait! This wasn't my...

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.980
To think you would resort to dirty tricks to take away my Amane-san!

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.820
Dishonorable louse!

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.720
Seiryo-sensei...!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.120
You're horrible, Seina-sama!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:05.060
You're trying to destroy the Balouta kingdom!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.660
Ryoko-san! You've got it all wrong!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.160
Big Brother Seina...

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.930
N- Neige-chan...

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:13.500
You're terrible for forcing me to marry you...!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:19.640
You're... you're so stupid!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:21.340
Neige-chan! Wait!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:23.980
You've got it all wrong!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.480
Kiriko-san...

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:30.190
Seina-chan. Never come into space ever again!

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:33.250
Kiriko-san! It wasn't me...!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:41.090
Kiriko-san! Kiriko-san!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.090
Kiriko-san!

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.290
Just a dream...

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.390
It's rather lively now, isn't it?

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:08.020
There are lots of members and relatives of each family, after all.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.690
The Yamada family, the Masaki Jurai family,

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.430
the Kaunaq family, the Balouta family, the Melmas family...

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.800
We really worked hard, didn't we?

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:19.540
The table arrangements, what order everyone's speeches go in...

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.210
Seto-sama was kind enough to be patient for us...

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:27.180
Somebody asked if we were holding a big Galactic Union conference here.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.680
Aw, I should've included one in the program!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.650
At any rate, we did well to organize a celebration this big

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.750
in such a short amount of time!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:38.450
Seto-sama's contacts certainly helped a lot!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:41.120
Come to think of it, she doesn't seem to be here yet...

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:44.460
No, she said she was going to visit with his parents.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:47.700
We're so indebted to you, Seto-sama!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.530
And to think you would go so far as to be the matchmaker!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:54.270
Think nothing of it! I'm the one who's been a burden to you all!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.440
That reminds me, what about Utsutsumi-sama?

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:01.770
"We are here on this beautiful day to honor..."

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.890
Seina-kun.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.260
You should start getting ready...

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:16.390
Airi-san.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:22.100
Do you think it's really OK for me to marry Kiriko-san and the others?

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.500
I still haven't asked them how they feel about it,

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:28.440
and even if it is my assignment, a political marriage is a little too...

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:31.070
You hate them, then?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.110
Of course I don't.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:33.810
But...

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:36.980
You're right. So let's go check for ourselves!

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.240
Check what...?!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.650
Here we are.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.050
Seina!

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.120
Fuku...

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.150
What do you think, Seina?

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:20.610
We just got them back at the last minute after having them altered.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.890
They look good on us, don't you think?

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.800
Or maybe you don't like them so much...?

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.290
Seina!

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:34.100
Y-you're all really pretty!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.300
I'm glad you think so!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:40.210
We were just about to get different dresses if you didn't like these ones!

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:44.410
Dresses that would please you, and only you, Seina!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.640
Eh? Oh, you're pretty too, Fuku!

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.890
The Kamidake is officially your ship now,

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:55.360
so Fuku-chan is going to be your wife too!

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.090
Do you even know what that means?

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.330
I'm the prettiest, aren't I, Big Brother?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.330
What are you saying? I'm the prettiest, aren't I?

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.000
Don't be stupid! I'm obviously the prettiest!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.040
Knock it off, you're being pathetic!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.710
- Pathetic, huh?! - I'm the prettiest here!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.480
What do you think, Mr. Groom?

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.580
Yamada-sama.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.670
Your suit-fitting preparations have been completed.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.650
I'm so glad! They weren't against it at all!

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:24.050
Right this way.

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.390
Eh? Oh, right!

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:32.820
This looks like a storage bay to me...

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.190
What're you doing?!

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.730
N-no way...!

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.460
It can't be...!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:46.170
Did you think I was dead?!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.650
T- Tarant...?!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:54.280
I refuse to be killed by the likes of you!

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.580
That's not all!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:12.330
I'm going to stuff your lifeless corpse inside a container!

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:23.610
And I'm going to use this to tear that Kiriko girl into pieces!

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:27.710
Cry, scream, and die!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:34.620
What?! Sealant gel?!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:47.170
What?! Damn you, Seina Yamada...!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.840
Tarant! I...

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.920
I'm here to clean!

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:02.850
Mitoto-san?!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.340
Oh? Seina-chan...

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:23.410
Hurry! It's nearly time to greet the guests!

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.270
- Work! Work! - He sure is working hard.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.440
This place is his...

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:27.940
"Tennan Wedding Chapel"

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:27.940
This place is his...

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:32.050
I see. So our ex-captain has a shrewd business sense.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:35.520
And I thought I'd have time to relax and eat lots of great food...!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:36.590
Stop loafing around!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:38.450
Sorry!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:40.460
Who would have imagined he was still alive...

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.430
My deepest apologies.

00:10:42.430 --> 00:10:46.730
It appears that he snuck in disguised as Mitoto.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:51.200
Our ID check system was supposedly fool-proof, but I guess not...

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:53.000
I'm sorry, Seina-kun.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.300
That's OK!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:58.010
But being able to capture Tarant all by yourself like that...

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:01.680
Amane and the others must have been exceptional teachers.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:05.310
Seina-kun has great amounts of actual experience too.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:08.580
This sure is one impressive affair...

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.920
Not too shabby, kid.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:15.360
I've been expecting you.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:19.000
After all, we can't do anything without the parents or the matchmaker.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.260
I'm sorry for being late.

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.700
I've heard the news.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.030
I apologize.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.000
Good thing nothing serious came of it.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.710
But it does sound like the sort of thing that might happen to Seina-dono.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.680
Excuse me! Can I see my brother before the ceremony?

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.640
Yes, go right ahead! He'll be delighted!

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:36.810
Great!

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.150
She says it's OK!

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:42.520
Now then, please allow me to show you to the waiting room.

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:54.930
Just give it up. We don't even know if she's here or not.

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:57.470
She's definitely here! I can feel it!

00:11:57.470 --> 00:12:00.200
Elma-san! My Elma-san!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.080
Care for a refill?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.280
Yeah. Thanks...

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.150
What're you doing?!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:18.390
Tennan Group is in charge of this ceremony, you see...

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:20.290
Those three morons are working here too.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:21.660
We love it!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.490
I didn't think I'd ever see you again...

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.030
For your birthday.

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:44.640
T-thank you very much!

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:54.360
Brother!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.890
Can we come in? Too late, we're coming in anyway!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.030
Come on!

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.930
Hey there, Brother Seina!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:00.930
Eh?!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:04.230
D-don't tell me that the two of you're...

00:13:04.230 --> 00:13:05.840
Yeah, something like that!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.540
What?! Since when?!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:10.810
Don't get me wrong, I'm completely OK with it, but...

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:14.480
But it's still too early for you to call me "brother"!

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.810
What're you talking about?

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:19.250
You're marrying my sister Kiriko, so that makes you my brother!

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.680
You're right!

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:25.250
It totally blew my mind when I heard that you and Kiriko went into space!

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:28.090
Though some crazy stuff did happen to me, too.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:32.130
Crazy stuff? Don't tell me you were attacked by pirates too!

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.200
No, I just had to be in this little ceremony...

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.200
Kai-kun looked so cool during it!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.770
Y-you think?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:40.040
Kai-kun!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.800
Yo-chan!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.500
What did you come here for?!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:45.880
- Yo-chan! - Kai-kun!

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.210
You attendants are here as well?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.040
Thanks for coming all the way while you're so busy...

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.280
Please forgive us, Seina-sama.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:57.290
U-uh... What in the world are you...

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:00.690
Please forgive us for concealing our true identities this entire time!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:04.030
The truth is, we're from another federation that hasn't joined

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.360
the Galactic Union.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.830
Another federation?!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:13.600
Certain pirates have their sights set on our Renza Federation too!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:18.940
We were impressed by your ability to destroy Da Ruma so quickly!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:22.180
Please lend us your abilities too!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.580
Please!

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:26.120
I'd like to help, but there's not much I can do now...

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.250
I was just appointed to a position in the GP,

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.350
and more importantly, there's the wedding ceremony now...

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:33.120
Right, Yoshiko? Kai?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.460
Please!

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:40.930
Thank you all for taking time out of your busy schedules to be here today.

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:42.670
We are here to observe the marriage between the Yamada family,

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:45.940
the Masaki Jurai family, the Kaunaq family, the Balouta family,

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:49.170
and the Melmas family.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:02.510
First, the four brides will come out!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.860
Seina Yamada, the groom,

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:46.290
will now make his appearance from the main doors!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.470
"Groom Enters Room"

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.690
Uh...

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.310
My brother was kidnapped!

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:22.770
What were that lousy old hag and her cronies thinking?!

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:24.600
I've located them! Distance 4000!

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.000
OK! After 'em!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.540
I've never seen this model before!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.840
Pirates?!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.910
It's called the Kaiesho... It's a Renza Federation ship!

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.840
Renza? So it's a non-Union ship?!

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:40.180
Can't we go any faster?!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.790
They're in the Kamidake, you know! We won't lose them that easily...

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.090
Come on! If this keeps up Kiriko and the others are gonna catch us!

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:49.360
That's odd. Calculations show that we should be going faster...

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:53.360
I'll check in the back!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.030
Hi there!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.370
What're you doing...?

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:01.870
Same as always! But this time in a place where she can't catch me!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:05.340
They sure put a lot of work into the entertainment, huh?

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:08.510
The groom gets abducted and the brides go to his rescue...

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.910
Four brides, at that...

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:13.480
But seeing as how Seina's the groom, maybe he really was kidnapped...

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.450
It's entirely possible!

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:19.620
You remembered my birthday...

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.430
A good captain knows everything about his crew.

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.830
In the case, the Unko crew...

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:30.430
I'm so happy; nobody's remembered my birthday for years...!

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:31.500
I feel like I'm about to blush...

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.970
What's this now?

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:35.200
What is going on, Seto-sama?!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.410
To think they would do it at a time like this...

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.870
Y-you don't mean...

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.580
"Groom Abducted"

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.580
W-what's going to happen to Seina?

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:47.920
I don't know what their goal is, but I don't think they'll hurt Seina-kun.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.490
Let's leave this to the Kamidake for the time being.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:54.120
It would just aggravate them more if we chased them in large numbers...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.360
Got it? Don't push them too far!

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:02.000
We know. They are holding Seina-kun hostage, after all!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.230
NB-sama too!

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:05.430
We're catching up!

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:10.040
This is really bad! They're catching up!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.770
What do we do, Hakuren?!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.610
Throw out everything absolutely unnecessary!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:18.550
Like all those cakes, fancy clothes, Juraian souvenir dolls, and cookies...

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:20.950
But they tasted so good...

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:25.550
All that's left to throw out now is...

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.290
No! These are my life!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.330
We ain't runnin' away for your sake!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.660
I need them to restart my life in the new world!

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.330
We'll get caught if we don't throw them out!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:37.530
If they're NB-sama's life, then we have no other choice.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:39.640
What?!

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:42.970
We'll have to throw him out too.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:45.510
Freaks! Monsters! Now what am I supposed to do?!

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.110
NB-sama!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:51.110
I'm here to save you!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:53.320
I forgot this feeling...!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:58.950
Even if I am ugly and a wimp, I still have you!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.580
Nabiko!

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:04.890
This gag again?!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.430
Hey, you! There's no escape now!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.560
Give back Seina!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:15.670
Hi...

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.010
S- Seina...! What're you doing?!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.210
No, I can explain...!

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:23.950
Karen, Hakuren! You can explain later, so just let Seina-chan go!

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.650
I promise not to get mad at you!

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:28.480
We can't do that, not even for you, Kiriko!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.950
We have no choice! It's for justice!

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:34.290
You kidnapped Seina-sama and now you talk about justice?!

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:38.390
Just leave us alone! Seina-sama's eloping with us!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:39.990
You lie!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:43.770
If you think we're lying, then we'll MAKE you believe!

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.630
Make them believe...?!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:48.600
What are you doing, Suiren?! And here of all places!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.440
What's the point of it all if we can't even do this with Seina-sama here!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:52.670
You've got a point there...

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.410
Hey, you! Get away from my Seina!

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.010
You mean OUR Seina!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:59.410
We don't have time to goof around with you!

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:03.320
If we don't do this then we won't give him back for your anti-pirate unit!

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.250
- That wouldn't be good at all...! - In that case...!

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.420
Stop acting like you own him!

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.660
It would seem that the story has taken a strange direction...

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.330
It's a lovers' quarrel, isn't it?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.660
Seto-sama! We have to do something!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.370
Well, we probably should...

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:21.300
But it's so interesting that we should watch more and see what happens!

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.640
Seto-sama!

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:27.440
Don't tell me you knew that they were spies from another federation!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.280
We have no choice! Seina-sama!

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:36.550
Doing this with everyone watching might seem kind of dirty, but...!

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:38.950
Wait...! Not there!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:41.760
If you think it's dirty then stop it!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.490
Seina-sama's... - is just like a girl's... -

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:46.730
What are you doing?! Stop it!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:51.000
...and this...!

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:54.770
- Here goes. - Eh?!... so suddenly?!

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.510
Oh, my!

00:20:56.510 --> 00:21:02.600
What're you doing to my Seina?! Let him go!

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:16.690
Six enemy ships detected! Distance 1400!

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.030
They're B-class pirate ships, all right!

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:22.330
We finally caught 'em! Battle stations!

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:26.130
Not so fast! Today's my turn to give the orders to attack!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:29.200
So what? Seina can do just fine with my help alone!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:31.970
They're so loud I can't concentrate on my work...!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.710
That's my line!

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.240
What's the meaning of my life?

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:37.870
Shaddup and take care of the kids!

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:41.720
Captain. Give us our orders, please.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:45.720
Uh, for now, let's go to where the pirates are.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:46.860
Understood!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.080
Captain!

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:52.820
Full speed ahead!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...


00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!
